flowchart TD
    A[Untrusted event or agent proposal] --> B[Input contract and schema validation]
    B -->|Malformed or missing data| M[Fail closed: BLOCKED or MANUAL_REVIEW]
    B -->|Structurally valid| C[Deterministic domain policies]

    C --> D[Order lifecycle consistency]
    C --> E[Exception triage]
    C --> F[Order reconciliation]
    C --> G[Action governance]

    D --> H[Operational orchestration]
    E --> H
    F --> H
    G --> H

    H --> I[Structured decision report and reasons]
    I --> J{Policy outcome}
    J -->|Invalid or unknown input| M
    J -->|Elevated risk or side effect| R[Human review or approval required]
    J -->|Checks passed| Q[READY_FOR_HUMAN_REVIEW]

    M --> K[No business action executed]
    R --> K
    Q --> K
    K --> L[Regression tests, replay, policy impact and release-readiness checks]

    style M fill:#ffe8e8,stroke:#b42318,color:#7a271a
    style R fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#b54708,color:#7a2e0e
    style Q fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b5e20
